  "releaseNotes": "- Performance: HTML parser avoids `ToCharArray()` allocations in several code paths: `EmitToAttributeValue` now iterates the substituted string directly; `Cons(char[])` and `Cons(string)` use `StringBuilder.Append` directly; `Pop(count)` uses `Array.init` instead of creating an integer range array; CDATA opening marker no longer creates a temporary `char[]`.",
